; Differential test of the promise core: random programs run on the current
; core and on a vendored copy of the historical core, comparing every
; observable event. See differential.ml. Not on Windows: it isolates the
; historical core in forked children and guards each run with an alarm.

(test
 (name differential)
 (package lwt)
 (modules differential lwt_historical)
 (enabled_if
  (<> %{os_type} Win32))
 (libraries lwt unix qcheck-core qcheck-core.runner))
